OL,3,GNEWSAErin survived cancer aged 21 - now
OL,4,Ait's a race against time for a chance
OL,5,Aof a baby
OL,6,
OL,7,FHaving life-saving cancer treatment at
OL,8,Fthe age of 21 would be hard enough for
OL,9,Fanyone. Erin Lavery was told she may
OL,10,Fnever be able to have children too.
OL,12,FShe didn't get the chance for egg
OL,13,Fpreservation before starting her
OL,14,Ftreatment.
OL,16,FNow she faces a race against time - and
OL,17,Fan #8,000 bill - for post-cancer
OL,18,Ffertility treatment if she is to have a
OL,19,Fchance of a baby in years to come.
OL,23,APub: 17-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,430,420,260,160,0,100
