OL,3,GNEWSAErin survived cancer aged 21 - now
OL,4,Ait's a race against time for a chance
OL,5,Aof a baby
OL,6,
OL,7,FErin, from Cambuslang near Glasgow,
OL,8,Fsays it's an immense decision for any
OL,9,Fyoung woman to have to make about their
OL,10,Ffuture.
